    "上述访问期限从原始授权签发时起算，撤销通知和相关内容清理仍待实现或验证。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That access period starts when the original authorization is issued. Revocation notices and related content cleanup still need implementation or verification."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El plazo comienza al emitirse la autorización original. Los avisos de revocación y la limpieza del contenido aún requieren implementación o verificación."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このアクセス期間は元の認可の発行時から計算されます。取り消し通知と関連コンテンツの削除は実装または検証待ちです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "위 접근 기간은 최초 권한 발급 시점부터 계산합니다. 취소 알림과 관련 콘텐츠 정리는 구현 또는 검증 대기 중입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上述访问期限从原始授权签发时起算，撤销通知和相关内容清理仍待实现或验证。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上述訪問期限從原始授權簽發時起算，撤銷通知和相關內容清理仍待實現或驗證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不会自动转移所有权，也不会把工作区删除混入账号删除。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ownership will not transfer automatically. Workspace deletion is handled separately from account deletion."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La propiedad no se transferirá automáticamente. La eliminación del espacio se gestiona por separado de la cuenta."
